    <div class="verify-note">Scene confirmed: small boat with water gushing through the hull, the shark wearing a bib and holding a fork and knife, life buoy, anchor and coral in the water. Late moves were watched in order (fork deflates the buoy at 1:05, buoy plugs the hole at 1:10, coral over the hole at 1:15, rescue helicopter at 1:20). Note that this level is labelled Level 42/43/49 by different channels — the older uploads do not match the current order.</div>
